1. Separates multiplier conditioning from addition logic  
2. Uses explicit 3-level adder tree with carry propagation  
3. Allows parallel multiplier execution (5 parallel MUL units)  
4. Minimizes critical path to 1 multiplier + 3 adders  
5. Avoids sequential accumulation dependency chain  
6. Maintains exact original size-dependent behavior
