- Eliminate all RAM interfaces through complete partitioning  
- Override potential tool conservatism with explicit unroll directives  
- Break up multiply-accumulate patterns into parallelizable operations  
- Leverage FPGA fabric for distributed multiplication while reserving DSPs for fast summation
